    "body": "Calling this `excludes` seems a little odd to me. `excludes` is a verb and `filters` (at least in my head) is used as a noun. I'd like to rename it to `exclusionFilters` so it's clearer that both attributes hold sets of filters but one set of filters has the opposite effect from the other set.",
